  "postText": "<p><HTML><HEAD><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\"></HEAD><body></p>\n<div align=\"center\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/155/8bc7f4f7196e0d5887a3411f2226f7f2..jpg\"></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">6ヶ月当日！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">なにしてたかというと、、、！！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">朝５時に起きて魔法ガッコに行っていました、、</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">ツラ、、</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">ほんとに週三日くらい５時起き生活なってしまった</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">人間すぎるーッッ！！！！いやーーっ！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">でも今日はちゃんと定期更新できたよー</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">えらいね！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">50分くらい並んだよ！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">つらいね！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">明日も五時おきだ！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">気が狂うね！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/155/0f5825b1f537e78c04dccf9d23e87cc6..jpg\"></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">目に光がないやつです</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">てことで7ヶ月目もよろしくおねがいしまつ</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">おわりです</div>\n<div align=\"center\"></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<p></body></HTML></p>\n",
